title: Status
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.unemployed) {
    Q.unemployed_2 = Q.unemployed.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.inflation) {
    Q.inflation_2 = Q.inflation.toFixed(1);
}
Q.economic_growth_2 = '0';
if (Q.economic_growth) {
    Q.economic_growth_2 = Q.economic_growth.toFixed(1);
}
!}

= **Status**

[+ week : week +] [+ month : month +] [+ year +]

Funds: [+ funds +]

Quarterly Income: [? if total_income > 0 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">+[+ total_income +]</span> ?][? if total_income < 0 : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">-[+ total_income +]</span> ?][? if total_income = 0 : <span style="color: #FFB74D;">-[+ total_income +]</span> ?]

<span style="color: #10186e">**KMT**</span> Leader: [+ kmt_leader +]

Internal dissent: [+ dissent_percent : dissent +]

= **Government**

President of the <span style="color: #9e1515">Be</span><span style="color: #ab881f">iy</span><span style="color: #2587b8">a</span><span style="color: #c7c7c7">n</span><span style="color: #000000">g</span> Government: [+ beiyang_leader +] ([? if beiyang_leader_party = "Zhili": <span style="color: #aba133">Zhili</span>?][? if beiyang_leader_party = "Fengtian": <span style="color: #d1b24b">Fengtian</span>?][? if beiyang_leader_party = "Anhui": <span style="color: #46703e">Anhui</span>?][? if beiyang_leader_party = "Guomindang": <span style="color: #10186e">Guomindang</span>?])

Premier of the <span style="color: #9e1515">Be</span><span style="color: #ab881f">iy</span><span style="color: #2587b8">a</span><span style="color: #c7c7c7">n</span><span style="color: #000000">g</span> Government: [+ deputy_beiyang_leader +] ([? if deputy_beiyang_leader_party = "Zhili": <span style="color: #aba133">Zhili</span>?][? if deputy_beiyang_leader_party = "Fengtian": <span style="color: #d1b24b">Fengtian</span>?][? if deputy_beiyang_leader_party = "Anhui": <span style="color: #46703e">Anhui</span>?][? if deputy_beiyang_leader_party = "Guomindang": <span style="color: #10186e">Guomindang</span>?])

