= **Economics**

Income: [? if income > 0 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">+[+ income +]</span> ?][? if income < 0 : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">-[+ income +]</span> ?][? if income = 0 : <span style="color: #FFB74D;">-[+ income +]</span> ?]

Military Expenses: [? if total_income > 0 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">+[+ total_income +]</span> ?][? if total_income < 0 : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">-[+ total_income +]</span> ?][? if total_income = 0 : <span style="color: #FFB74D;">-[+ total_income +]</span> ?]

Total: [? if total_income < 0 : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">-[+ total_income +]</span> ?][? if total_income = 0 : <span style="color: #FFB74D;">-[+ total_income +]</span> ?]

